  "bodyHash": "fa0a32a79d10e7f9",
  "content": "\n\n<p>每次激活<span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 153); --darkreader-inline-color: #988f81;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><a style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 153); --darkreader-inline-color: #988f81;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">界石</a></span>時都要手動在<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 153, 0); --darkreader-inline-color: #ffa31a;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><a style=\"color: rgb(255, 153, 0); --darkreader-inline-color: #ffa31a;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/antique-atlas\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0); --darkreader-inline-color: #ff751a;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">古舊地圖</span></a></span>上添加標記點非常麻煩，所以我將它自動化了！</p>\n<p>現在，每當你激活界石時，只要背包裡有古舊地圖，它就會自動新增一個以該界石命名的標記點。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>\n\n[\n![在 BisectHosting 使用優惠碼「HorribleNerd」享 25% 折扣](https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/990eac5d-2336-4a3d-b0e4-11f7bfc8b227.webp \"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/990eac5d-2336-4a3d-b0e4-11f7bfc8b227.webp\")](https://bisecthosting.com/HorribleNerd \"https://bisecthosting.com/HorribleNerd\")</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>此模組僅支援 Forge，且必須同時安裝於<em>客戶端</em>與<em>伺服器</em>上。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>與<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0); --darkreader-inline-color: #1aff1a;\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><a style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0); --darkreader-inline-color: #1aff1a;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towers-of-the-wild\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\">荒野之塔</a></span>搭配使用效果也非常棒！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/335/942/antiquewaystones.png\" alt=\"地圖中的標記點截圖\" width=\"738\" height=\"458\"></p>",
